    {
      "id": "transformer-attention",
      "title": "Transformer：从 Token 到 Logits",
      "chapter": "model",
      "summary": "用张量形状连接 Tokenizer、Attention、MLP、GQA、LM Head 与 KV Cache 的容量和计算约束。",
      "recall": {
        "question": "为什么增加序列长度会改变 Attention 的开销，但 GQA 主要影响 KV 容量？",
        "answer": "全序列 Attention 的打分涉及 query 和 key 的序列维度，GQA 共享 KV Head，不减少 Query Head 数量。",
        "spoken": "上下文长度影响注意力计算；KV Head 数决定缓存规模的一部分。"
      },
      "keywords": [
        "transformer",
        "attention",
        "GQA",
        "MLP",
        "tokenizer",
        "logits",
        "RoPE",
        "KV Cache"
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "implementations": [],
      "source": "topics/model/transformer-attention.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "policy-gradient",
      "title": "一次 Reward 怎么更新 Policy？",
      "chapter": "rl",
      "summary": "区分一次采样的梯度和策略目标的期望梯度。",
      "recall": {
        "question": "Reward 不可微，还能更新模型参数吗？",
        "answer": "可以。对采样动作的 Logprob 求导，Reward 充当系数；要区分单样本估计与期望。",
        "spoken": "评分不提供导数，导数来自已采样动作的对数概率。"
      },
      "keywords": [
        "policy",
        "gradient",
        "reinforce",
        "reward",
        "expectation"
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "implementations": [],
      "source": "topics/rl/policy-gradient.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "ppo-grpo",
      "title": "PPO / GRPO 的优化目标",
      "chapter": "rl",
      "summary": "从 Ratio、Clip 到 Group Advantage，辨别更新目标与估计器。",
      "recall": {
        "question": "PPO Clip 能限制全策略的 KL 吗？",
        "answer": "不能。它截断特定样本的 Surrogate 梯度，不是全分布硬约束。",
        "spoken": "Clip 管的是样本层面的更新方向，KL 仍需要按明确口径监控。"
      },
      "keywords": [
