    {
      "id": "logprob-contract",
      "title": "Token Logprob 与训练目标",
      "chapter": "learner",
      "summary": "Shift、Action Mask、Reduction 与 Policy Version 必须对齐。",
      "recall": {
        "question": "Loss 正常下降就代表 Token 对齐正确吗？",
        "answer": "不代表。预测位置错一格或 Mask 包含 Observation，Shape 仍可能合法。",
        "spoken": "先核对 Token、概率分布和 Mask，再解释 Loss 变化。"
      },
      "keywords": [
        "logprob",
